{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"成立。H1-H3已建立：亲近曾带来满足，但满足之后更深的所求仍在，而且再次亲近反而让“还想要更多”更清楚，因此“原有的满足不再够用”有明确历史依据。S05-B1又直接给出原先的支撑突然撤去、只剩孤零零的旋律、前路未卜；S05-B2也呈现从“我与你”中抽身、谈话中止以及对幸福能否维持的疑问，所以“别的可能还不能成为依靠”可理解为对眼下尚无新支撑、未来又不确定的概括，并未凭空编造具体人物前史或事件。由这种“旧的满足已不够、新的支撑又未成立”的落差推出“空落、悬着、有一点孤单”，提供了实际原因，而不只是重述结果。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S05-B1：尚未具体解释时间仿佛松开、漫无目的游走以及漂入雾中所带来的方向感消失。\",\"S05-B2：尚未解释那句重要的话没有说出口的欲言又止，以及“这份幸福真实吗、能维持多久”的具体自我怀疑。\",\"S05-B3：尚未解释此前用力抓紧的冲动为什么在此处退下去，以及“松开手、深吸一口气”所体现的放松/卸力感。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c0391a10-f72a-4997-99a3-d6162564aa10", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045616824084Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:28.914472+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc152e1d7d3c5b8562e651a6633a6503634a4bc130c9c741fe193fb6b90002ec", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683